{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5101","label":"Red Hood"},"label":"Who We Are","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_RedHood_01","next":"d_nikke_RedHood_03","speakers":{"redhood":"Red Hood","Self":"Commander","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon"},"icons":{"redhood":"si_c470_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_1","text":"Have any of you ever heard of the Grimms models?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02_n","bgArt":"desert_02_n","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["redhood","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_2","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_2","text":"A few times, yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_weare","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_3","text":"But it doesn't sound like you're overly familiar with them, no?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_4","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_4","text":"Only names, nothing more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_5","text":"Well, they could almost be considered the first Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_6","text":"Why almost? Weren't they literally the first batch?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_7","text":"Because the true prototype was someone else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_8","text":"I don't even know if it'd be appropriate to consider her a Nikke, though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_9","text":"I feel you'd have to come up with another word to do her justice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_10","text":"Anyway, the Grimms models are Nikkes produced using the technology from that Prototype.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_11","text":"If it wasn't obvious enough from the name, the guiding theme for this series was fairy tales.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_12","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_12","text":"Why fairy tales?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_13","text":"I can't remember exactly, but I seem to recall it having something with them like a fairy tale ending.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_14","text":"I'm lost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_15","text":"Fairy tales usually have happy endings, so maybe the scientists thought it'd be auspicious calling you guys that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_16","text":"That would be my best guess.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_17","text":"Anyway, the Grimms models were produced with all kinds of different technologies, so it was difficult to find suitable candidates.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_18","text":"But in the end, they managed to scrounge up enough to make a team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_19","text":"They can be considered, more or less, the original Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_20","text":"That team of Grimms models is what we all know as the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_21","text":"Waddya think about that? Doesn't our origin story make us sound super cool?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_22","text":"Original Nikkes... suitable candidates... all these great buzzwords that just ooze awesomeness!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_23","text":"What did you all do before the transformation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_24","text":"Come again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_25","text":"You said it was hard to find eligible candidates. What criteria did you have to meet?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_26","text":"I heard it was nothing special.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_27","text":"Apparently you just had to meet all the physical requirements.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_28","text":"Wow. So, you guys didn't really have too much in common?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_29","text":"Nope. We were from all walks of life when we were humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_30","text":"So, unsurprisingly, we often got on each other's nerves at first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_31","text":"We'd argue about who was stronger, how to do things,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_32","text":"whether to go left or right at a crossroads...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_33","text":"We had conflicting views on just about everything, ranging from big to small.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_34","text":"In our defense, we were often dealing with matters of life and death, so it sort of makes sense emotions were running high.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_35","text":"Thanks to Boss and Lilith, though, we could usually push through. Still, I would never claim that we were on good terms with each other then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_36","text":"Eventually, a new member, Swordsman, joined us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["hongryeon_o"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_37","text":"How the heck did that come about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_38","text":"You mean Scarlet?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_39","text":"Yes, her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_40","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_40","text":"So Scarlet was the last to join?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_41","text":"Yes. Lilith brought her in. From the very start, she was the real deal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02_n","bgArt":"desert_02_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_42","text":"She's not a Grimms model, and Lilith brought her into the fold without telling us in advance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_43","text":"Scarlet isn't a Grimms model?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_44","text":"Nope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_45","text":"She was from a squad comprised of select mass-produced Nikkes who specialized in melee combat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_46","text":"She underwent a whole host of modifications though, so by that point, she could hardly be considered a mass-produced model.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_47","text":"Dang, I would have never expected that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_48","text":"Anyway, her arrival only made the bickering amongst us worse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_49","text":"Just think about it; a sword user joining a squad where everyone else uses firearms?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_50","text":"It's practically like adding fuel to the fire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_51","text":"Oddly enough though, it was precisely at this time","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_52","text":"that everyone started to get along with each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_53","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_54","text":"Really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_55","text":"I don't know which specific incident was the turning point, but everyone just started taking it easy on each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_56","text":"Out of the blue? For no discernible reason?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_57","text":"Yep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_58","text":"Actually, looking back on it,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_59","text":"things seemed to improve markedly after we met a family of refugees on the way back from the battlefield.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_60","text":"They all broke down and thanked us profusely, calling us mankind's last hope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_61","text":"The whole encounter only lasted for probably 20 seconds, 30 seconds tops.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_62","text":"But if you ask me, that's where things started to change for us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_02_63","text":"It made us understand","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"